Subject: [PATCH] tests: load fixtures by their canonical import paths

Relative patterns under testdata resolve to local import IDs in GOPATH mode.
Use the canonical import paths already computed by the test so package loading
and the expected Unit keys refer to the same packages. Keep every fixture,
load mode and assertion.

Upstream: https://github.com/go-toolsmith/pkgload/blob/v1.2.2/pkgload_test.go
Status: Not submitted; downstream GOPATH test compatibility fix.

diff --git a/pkgload_test.go b/pkgload_test.go
